---
layout: default
---
{%- comment -%}
  Local override of al_folio_core's about layout (see README_UPDATE.md). v5 "loss landscape" home (plan.md §2, changes 1–5).
  Content keys come from the front matter of _pages/about.md (kicker = role line, name_prefix, hero_tagline, research_areas, profile).
  Motion lives in assets/js/home.js + assets/custom/home.css (loaded only on this layout), not in motion.js:
  the whole page carries data-motion-skip and no data-reveal / data-count attributes, so nothing is animated twice.
    - hero: home.js adds a live contour field (canvas) over the watercolour .hero-art; click or tap drops a descent dot.
    - name: [data-kinetic] is split into letters by home.js (desktop only; phones paint it at once for LCP).
    - stats: [data-odo] digits roll like an odometer; the plain number stays in the markup (no JS, print, screen readers).
    - [data-since-date] on "Years at AIT" is recomputed by home.js so it never goes stale (build-time value is the fallback).
  The primary button opens the interactive office (root index.html or room/index.html, see office_url.liquid).
{%- endcomment -%}
<div class="post about-page" data-motion-skip>
  {%- comment -%} Hide the hero items until home.js runs, only on desktop with motion allowed (same guard as motion.css, 3 s failsafe). {%- endcomment -%}
  <script>
    !(function (d) {
      try {
        if (d.classList.contains('motion-pending') && matchMedia('(min-width: 900px)').matches) {
          d.classList.add('home-pending');
          setTimeout(function () {
            d.classList.remove('home-pending');
          }, 3000);
        }
      } catch (e) {}
    })(document.documentElement);
  </script>
  <section class="about-hero" data-hero data-home-hero>
    <div class="hero-art" data-parallax="80" aria-hidden="true"></div>
    <div class="hero-step hero-step-1">
      <div class="hero-text">
        {% if page.kicker %}
          <p class="hero-role" data-home-in>{{ page.kicker }}</p>
        {% endif %}
        <h1 class="post-title hero-title">
          {% if page.name_prefix -%}
            <span class="name-prefix" data-home-in>{{ page.name_prefix }}</span>
          {%- endif %}
          <span class="name-main" data-kinetic>
            {{- site.first_name }}
            {{ site.middle_name }}
            {{ site.last_name -}}
          </span>
        </h1>
        {% assign hero_tagline = page.hero_tagline | default: page.tagline %}
        {% if hero_tagline %}
          <p class="hero-tagline" data-home-in>{{ hero_tagline }}</p>
        {% endif %}
        {% include office_url.liquid %}
        <div class="hero-actions" data-home-in>
          {% if office_url -%}
            <a class="hero-cta" href="{{ office_url }}">
              {{- page.hero_cta_text | default: 'Explore the office' }}
              <span aria-hidden="true">&rarr;</span></a
            >
          {%- endif %}
          <a class="hero-link" href="{{ '/publications/' | relative_url }}">Publications</a>
        </div>
        <p class="hero-hint" aria-hidden="true">Click the contours to run gradient descent</p>
      </div>
      {% if page.profile and page.profile.image %}
        <div class="hero-portrait" data-parallax="24">
          <div class="portrait-frame" data-portrait>
            {% assign profile_image_path = page.profile.image | prepend: 'assets/img/' %}
            {%
              include figure.liquid loading="eager" path=profile_image_path class="img-fluid portrait-img" sizes="(min-width: 768px) 380px, 300px"
              alt="Prof. Vaishali S. Ingale" cache_bust=true
            %}
          </div>
        </div>
      {% endif %}
    </div>
  </section>

  {%- comment -%}
    Stats ledger from _data/stats.yml. "since" (YYYY-MM-DD) turns into whole years at build time; home.js recomputes it in the
    browser. Each number is printed as plain text inside .ledger-odo; home.js turns its digits into odometer columns.
  {%- endcomment -%}
  {% assign stats = site.data.stats %}
  {% if stats %}
    <section class="home-ledger" aria-label="At a glance">
      {% assign now_y = 'now' | date: '%Y' | plus: 0 %}
      {% assign now_md = 'now' | date: '%m%d' | plus: 0 %}
      {% for s in stats %}
        {% assign value = s.value %}
        {% if s.since %}
          {% assign since_str = s.since | date: '%Y-%m-%d' %}
          {% assign since_y = since_str | slice: 0, 4 | plus: 0 %}
          {% capture since_md %}{{ since_str | slice: 5, 2 }}{{ since_str | slice: 8, 2 }}{% endcapture %}
          {% assign since_md = since_md | plus: 0 %}
          {% assign value = now_y | minus: since_y %}
          {% if now_md < since_md %}{% assign value = value | minus: 1 %}{% endif %}
        {% endif %}
        {% assign stat_url = s.url %}
        {% if stat_url and stat_url != '' %}
          {% unless stat_url contains '://' %}{% assign stat_url = stat_url | relative_url %}{% endunless %}
        {% endif %}
        {% if value >= 1000 %}
          {% assign th = value | divided_by: 1000 -%}
          {%- assign rest = value | modulo: 1000 | prepend: '00' | slice: -3, 3 %}
          {% capture shown %}{{ th }},{{ rest }}{% endcapture %}
        {% else %}
          {% capture shown %}{{ value }}{% endcapture %}
        {% endif %}
        <div class="ledger-item{% if stat_url and stat_url != '' %} has-link{% endif %}">
          {% if stat_url and stat_url != '' %}<a class="ledger-link" href="{{ stat_url }}">{% endif %}
          <span class="ledger-num"
            ><span
              class="ledger-odo"
              data-odo
              {% if s.since %}
                data-since-date="{{ s.since | date: '%Y-%m-%d' }}"
              {% endif %}
            >
              {{- shown -}}
            </span>
            {%- if s.suffix and s.suffix != '' -%}
              <span class="ledger-suffix">{{ s.suffix }}</span>
            {%- endif -%}
          </span>
          <span class="ledger-label">{{ s.label }}</span>
          {% if s.since -%}
            <span class="ledger-note">since {{ s.since | date: '%B %Y' }}</span>
          {%- endif %}
          {% if stat_url and stat_url != '' %}</a>{% endif %}
        </div>
      {% endfor %}
    </section>
  {% endif %}

  <article class="home-body">
    {%- comment -%} The research index is inserted where _pages/about.md has the <!--research-index--> marker. {%- endcomment -%}
    {% capture research_index %}
      <ul class="research-index">
        {% for area in page.research_areas %}
          <li class="ri-item">
            <svg class="ri-glyph" viewBox="0 0 48 48" width="48" height="48" aria-hidden="true" focusable="false">
              {% case area.glyph %}
                {% when 'satellite' %}
                  <rect class="g-b" x="6" y="6" width="36" height="36" rx="3" />
                  <path class="g-d" pathLength="1" d="M6 31c6-3 10 3 16 0s9-8 14-6 4 2 6 1" />
                  <path class="g-d" pathLength="1" d="M6 21c5-3 9 2 15-1s8-7 13-6c3 1 5 0 8-2" />
                  <path class="g-d" pathLength="1" d="M29 35c1-3 6-4 8-2s0 5-3 5-6-1-5-3z" />
                  <path class="g-b g-faint" d="M6 13c4-2 8 1 13-1s7-5 12-4" />
                {% when 'medical' %}
                  <circle class="g-b" cx="24" cy="24" r="18" />
                  <circle class="g-b" cx="31" cy="22" r="3.5" />
                  <path class="g-d" pathLength="1" d="M28 20c-4-4-9-6-16-5" />
                  <path class="g-d" pathLength="1" d="M28 24c-4 4-9 7-16 7" />
                  <path class="g-d" pathLength="1" d="M33 19c1-4 0-7-2-10" />
                  <path class="g-d" pathLength="1" d="M33 25c1 4 0 8-3 11" />
                  <circle class="g-b g-faint" cx="18" cy="24" r="2" />
                {% when 'language' %}
                  <path class="g-b" d="M8 13h32M8 21h22M8 29h9M8 37h26" />
                  <path class="g-d" pathLength="1" d="M23 29h15" />
                  <rect class="g-d" pathLength="1" x="20" y="24.5" width="21" height="9" rx="4.5" />
                {% when 'security' %}
                  <rect class="g-b" x="10" y="22" width="28" height="20" rx="4" />
                  <path class="g-b" d="M16 22v-5a8 8 0 0 1 16 0v5" />
                  <circle class="g-d" pathLength="1" cx="24" cy="30.5" r="2.6" />
                  <path class="g-d" pathLength="1" d="M24 33v4.5" />
                  <path class="g-b g-faint" d="M5 30a19 19 0 0 0 4 10M43 30a19 19 0 0 1-4 10" />
              {% endcase %}
            </svg>
            <h3 class="ri-title">{{ area.title }}</h3>
            <p class="ri-text">{{ area.text }}</p>
          </li>
        {% endfor %}
      </ul>
    {% endcapture %}
    {{ content | replace: '<!--research-index-->', research_index }}

    {% if page.selected_papers %}
      <section class="home-section about-section" aria-labelledby="selected-publications">
        <h2 class="home-heading" id="selected-publications">Selected publications</h2>
        <div class="home-section-body">
          {% include selected_papers.liquid %}
          <p class="home-more"><a href="{{ '/publications/' | relative_url }}">All publications</a></p>
          <p class="image-credit">
            Figure thumbnails: V. Ingale, R. Singh, P. Patwal, <a href="https://arxiv.org/abs/2105.09253">arXiv:2105.09253</a> (CC BY-NC-SA 4.0).
          </p>
        </div>
      </section>
    {% endif %}

    {% if page.announcements and page.announcements.enabled %}
      <section class="home-section about-section home-news-section" aria-labelledby="recent-news">
        <h2 class="home-heading" id="recent-news">Recent news</h2>
        <div class="home-section-body">
          <div class="home-news">{% include news.liquid limit=true %}</div>
          <p class="home-more"><a href="{{ '/news/' | relative_url }}">All news</a></p>
        </div>
      </section>
    {% endif %}

    {% if page.social %}
      {% assign so = site.data.socials %}
      {% assign kit_email = so.email | default: 'vingale@aitpune.edu.in' %}
      <section class="social home-finale" aria-labelledby="contact-title" data-finale>
        <div class="finale-head">
          {%- comment -%} Contour lines converging on the email (a minimum). Static SVG; home.js draws it once on scroll. {%- endcomment -%}
          <svg class="finale-contours" viewBox="0 0 1200 520" preserveAspectRatio="xMidYMid slice" aria-hidden="true" focusable="false">
            <path pathLength="1" d="M986 262C987 276 984 294 980 304C975 315 968 319 959 325C949 332 937 336 924 341C911 345 895 348 878 352C861 355 842 357 820 359C798 361 781 363 744 364C708 365 648 365 600 365C552 365 492 364 456 363C420 362 404 360 383 358C362 356 345 353 329 349C313 346 301 342 289 337C278 333 268 328 260 322C251 316 245 312 239 302C234 292 229 276 227 262C225 248 224 231 225 220C227 210 231 204 237 198C244 191 253 186 265 181C278 176 293 172 311 169C329 166 350 164 374 162C398 161 417 160 455 160C493 160 553 160 600 161C647 162 703 163 738 165C773 166 788 168 809 170C830 172 848 174 865 177C882 179 898 182 912 186C926 190 939 194 950 200C960 206 969 210 975 220C981 231 985 248 986 262Z" />
